  "articleBody": "Replacing a shower involves more than choosing new tile or a glass door. The right scope depends on the existing shower’s size, plumbing, waterproofing, ventilation, accessibility needs, and whether the work changes walls or fixtures. Before hiring, obtain a written plan covering demolition, concealed-condition repairs, materials, permits, inspections, cleanup, and final payment.",
